      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Small field but several chances. NEW LEVEL (5) has been no match for ZIPITALIST last two but like him back to the mile and the winning, senior rider goes back aboard. Still better off at the weights and last time he was here he just missed in a similar race. Gets chance to atone. Hard to line up JUNE (2). No match in the rich Mackay Cup last time but was a BM78 winner at Eagle Farm the start prior. The rating from that win tops these. Much more weight here but hard to beat on best. TAPA KICK (6) was disappointing in tougher company last time but was a winner in a similar race to this the start prior. Can bounce back. ACEDROD (4) was a big winner last time at Blackall and will take catching in the small line-up. Then there's ZIPITALIST (1), who has won three of last four. Only query is having first try at the mile.",
